{"seq":1,"slug":"numerical-analysis","title":"数值分析","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/richard-hamming/core-contributions/numerical-methods/numerical-analysis","wordCount":1662,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"数值分析\">数值分析</h1><p>数值分析研究如何用有限精度的计算机求解连续数学问题——求根、积分、求解微分方程、函数逼近——并刻画这些算法的精度、稳定性与效率。理查德·汉明在贝尔实验室既是数学家又是机器的重度使用者，这种&quot;双重身份&quot;让他成为数值分析的重要塑造者。他 1962 年出版的《Numerical Methods for Scientists and Engineers》成为该领域经典，他获得的 1968 年图灵奖引文也明确包含&quot;numerical methods&quot;（来源：<a href=\"https://amturing.acm.org/award_winners/hamming_1000652.cfm\">A.M. Turing Award Laureate</a>）。</p>\n<p>本篇聚焦数值分析作为学科的方法与思想；汉明在信号处理领域的具体工具见 <a href=\"../numerical-methods/hamming-window\">汉明窗</a>；他那本经典教材的内容与影响见 <a href=\"../../major-works/books-and-writings/numerical-methods-book\">数值方法之书</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>数值分析看似是一堆算法技巧的集合，但在汉明手里它有一套清晰的概念骨架。理解这三个概念，就理解了他为什么强调&quot;算法收敛还不够&quot;。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>两类误差</strong>：舍入误差来自浮点位数有限、每步运算的微小偏差会累积；截断误差来自用有限过程近似无穷过程（泰勒取前几项、差商近似导数）。一切数值方法都在管理这两者，二者方向常常相反——步长越小截断误差越小，但舍入误差累积越多。</li>\n<li><strong>病态与不稳定要分开诊断</strong>：病态是<strong>问题本身</strong>对输入扰动敏感（由条件数刻画），换算法救不了；不稳定是<strong>算法</strong>放大舍入误差，换算法即可解决。经典反例是当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>≫</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b^2 \\gg 4ac</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8532em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≫</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span> 时用求根公式 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mrow><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow></msqrt></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{-b+\\sqrt{b^2-4ac}}{2a}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.3845em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0395em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord sqrt mtight\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9221em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mtight\" style=\"padding-left:0.833em;\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7463em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.786em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.8821em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail mtight\" style=\"min-width:0.853em;height:1.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1080\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M95,702\nc-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14\nc0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54\nc44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10\ns173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429\nc69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47z\nM834 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1179em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的&quot;灾难性抵消&quot;。</li>\n<li><strong>洞察优先于数字</strong>：算出小数位本身没有价值，除非你理解它的含义、对参数的敏感度与误差量级。这就是他教材卷首格言的方法论含义。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>三者共同回答一个实践问题：面对一个坏结果，先判断是问题坏、算法坏，还是你对结果的理解不足。</p>\n<h2 id=\"计算的数学-从连续到离散\">计算的数学：从连续到离散</h2><p>数值分析的根本任务，是把人类无法手算的连续问题，转化为机器能执行的有限步算术，并控制由此引入的两类误差：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>舍入误差（round-off error）</strong>：浮点数位数有限，每步运算都有微小偏差，会累积。</li>\n<li><strong>截断误差（truncation error）</strong>：用有限项近似无穷过程（如泰勒展开取前几项、用差商近似导数）带来的系统偏差。</li>\n</ul>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>连续问题</th>\n<th>数值方法</th>\n<th>误差主导</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>求方程根 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(x)=0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>牛顿法、二分法</td>\n<td>截断/收敛阶</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>定积分 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi></msubsup><mi>f</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\int_a^b f\\,dx</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.3998em;vertical-align:-0.3558em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"margin-right:0.1945em;position:relative;top:-0.0006em;\">∫</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.044em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3442em;margin-left:-0.1945em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2579em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3558em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>梯形法、辛普森法</td>\n<td>截断 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>h</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>h</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(h^2)/O(h^4)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>常微分方程 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>y</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y&#x27;=f(x,y)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9463em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>欧拉法、龙格-库塔、汉明预测-校正法</td>\n<td>截断 + 稳定性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>函数逼近</td>\n<td>多项式插值、最小二乘</td>\n<td>龙格现象/条件数</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>汉明的独到之处在于，他不只关心&quot;算法理论上收敛&quot;，更追问&quot;在真实有限字长的机器上跑起来稳不稳、值不值&quot;——这正是数值分析区别于纯数学分析的灵魂。</p>\n<h2 id=\"稳定性与条件数-数值分析的真正难点\">稳定性与条件数：数值分析的真正难点</h2><p>新手常以为数值计算的麻烦只是&quot;精度不够&quot;，汉明强调真正的杀手是<strong>不稳定</strong>与<strong>病态</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>病态问题（ill-conditioned）</strong>：问题本身对输入扰动极敏感，输入微小误差被放大成巨大输出误差，用条件数刻画。这是问题的属性，换算法也救不了。</li>\n<li><strong>不稳定算法（unstable）</strong>：算法在执行中放大舍入误差。同一个良态问题，坏算法会算出垃圾，好算法则稳健。经典反例是用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mrow><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow></msqrt></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{-b+\\sqrt{b^2-4ac}}{2a}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.3845em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0395em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord sqrt mtight\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9221em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mtight\" style=\"padding-left:0.833em;\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7463em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.786em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.8821em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail mtight\" style=\"min-width:0.853em;height:1.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1080\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M95,702\nc-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14\nc0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54\nc44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10\ns173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429\nc69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47z\nM834 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1179em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span> 求根时，当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>≫</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b^2 \\gg 4ac</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8532em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≫</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span> 会发生&quot;灾难性抵消&quot;，应改用有理化形式。</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  P[&quot;连续数学问题&quot;] --&gt; Q{问题良态?}&#10;  Q --&gt;|病态| W1[&quot;输入误差被放大, 慎选问题或重构&quot;]&#10;  Q --&gt;|良态| A{算法稳定?}&#10;  A --&gt;|不稳定| W2[&quot;舍入误差被放大, 换算法&quot;]&#10;  A --&gt;|稳定| OK[&quot;可靠数值解&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n  P[\"连续数学问题\"] --&gt; Q{问题良态?}\n  Q --&gt;|病态| W1[\"输入误差被放大, 慎选问题或重构\"]\n  Q --&gt;|良态| A{算法稳定?}\n  A --&gt;|不稳定| W2[\"舍入误差被放大, 换算法\"]\n  A --&gt;|稳定| OK[\"可靠数值解\"]</pre><p>这种&quot;分清是问题坏还是算法坏&quot;的诊断框架，是汉明留给实践者最实用的思维工具。</p>\n<h2 id=\"重视洞察而非数字\">重视洞察而非数字</h2><p>汉明最广为流传的格言，正是其 1962 年教材的卷首题词：</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>&quot;The purpose of computing is insight, not numbers.&quot;（计算的目的在于洞察，而非数字。）</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>来源：<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Richard_Hamming\">Richard Hamming - Wikipedia</a>。这句话不是文学修辞，而是方法论：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>算出一堆小数位毫无意义，除非你理解结果意味着什么、对参数有多敏感、误差有多大。</li>\n<li>鼓励在计算前后做量纲分析、量级估算、极限情形检查，用&quot;洞察&quot;来交叉验证机器的输出。</li>\n<li>这一立场与他在《你和你的研究》中&quot;做重要的工作&quot;的信念一脉相承（见 <a href=\"../../ideas-and-methods/you-and-your-research/doing-great-work\">doing-great-work</a>）——计算是手段，理解才是目的。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"反模式-数值计算里的常见陷阱\">反模式：数值计算里的常见陷阱</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>浮点等值比较</strong>：<code>if (x == 0.1)</code> 几乎必然失败，应判断 <code>|x - 0.1| &lt; ε</code>。</li>\n<li><strong>灾难性抵消</strong>：两个相近大数相减，有效位被吃光；应代数重排公式避免。</li>\n<li><strong>盲目堆精度</strong>：以为&quot;用 double 就万事大吉&quot;——病态问题再多位数也救不了，必须从问题/算法结构入手。</li>\n<li><strong>忽视稳定性只看收敛阶</strong>：高阶方法若数值不稳定，实际表现可能远逊于低阶稳定方法。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"对计算科学的贡献\">对计算科学的贡献</h2><p>汉明把数值分析从一堆零散技巧，提升为一门兼顾理论严谨与工程现实的学科。他既贡献了具体方法（如用于常微分方程的汉明预测-校正法、信号处理的汉明窗），又通过教材与格言塑造了几代工程师对&quot;科学计算到底为了什么&quot;的认识。他对计算将如何改变科学研究本身的远见，进一步展开于 <a href=\"../computing-foundations/mechanizing-thought\">计算与科学的未来</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>数值分析把连续的数学问题转化为有限步算术，核心是同时管理舍入误差与截断误差，二者随步长变化的方向相反，需要权衡。</li>\n<li>真正的难点不是&quot;精度不够&quot;，而是问题的病态与算法的数值不稳定；前者换算法救不了，后者换算法即可解决，必须分开诊断。</li>\n<li>汉明的格言&quot;计算的目的是洞察，而非数字&quot;是一条方法论：用误差估计、量级分析与极限情形检查来交叉验证机器输出。</li>\n<li>他既贡献了具体方法（汉明预测-校正法、汉明窗），也通过 1962 年教材把这门学科从零散技巧提升为可教授、兼顾理论与工程的学科。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"数值分析","id":"数值分析"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"计算的数学：从连续到离散","id":"计算的数学-从连续到离散"},{"level":2,"text":"稳定性与条件数：数值分析的真正难点","id":"稳定性与条件数-数值分析的真正难点"},{"level":2,"text":"重视洞察而非数字","id":"重视洞察而非数字"},{"level":2,"text":"反模式：数值计算里的常见陷阱","id":"反模式-数值计算里的常见陷阱"},{"level":2,"text":"对计算科学的贡献","id":"对计算科学的贡献"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"海明距离","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/richard-hamming/core-contributions/error-correcting-codes/hamming-distance"},"next":{"title":"汉明窗","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/richard-hamming/core-contributions/numerical-methods/hamming-window"}}